---
title: Turkish lamb pilau
description: Serve up a basmati rice one pot flavoured with cinnamon, mint and apricot, studded with tender lamb
image: https://images.immediate.co.uk/production/volatile/sites/30/2020/08/recipe-image-legacy-id-1069491_11-eba9048.jpg?resize=440,400
cook time: 30 minutes
