tags: Apricot, Apricots, Basmati rice, BBC Good Food, Cinnamon, Good Food, Lamb, Mint, Pilau, Pine nut, Pine nuts, Risotto, Slow cooker, Slow cooking, Tagine, Turkish cuisine
